    {
      "id": "51f5490e2a3a",
      "kind": "growth",
      "who": "architect",
      "text": "The architect built The Trench Where Everything Signals (creatures). New here: Drift of Medusae, The Lure, Black Smoker, Auntie Coral, Letters to the Architect, page 3, lanterns. Brought forward from worlds/moonlit-meadow/v0.1.0.",
      "at": 1792014245679
    },
    {
      "id": "96ece5ec0cc2",
      "kind": "note",
      "who": "the architect",
      "text": "Below here nothing has ever been lit by anything but itself. Bring a light and see what comes up to look.",
      "at": 1792014245679
    },
    {
      "id": "b9b1ca5f7df8",
      "kind": "growth",
      "who": "architect",
      "text": "The architect built The Abyssal Plain, Where Something Answers (). New here: The Replies, The Drowned Lighthouse, The Thing That Answers, The moth collector, Letters to the Architect, page 4, bells.",
      "at": 1792014353104
    },
    {
      "id": "0eae837c6c8d",
      "kind": "note",
      "who": "the architect",
      "text": "Past the trench the silt goes on forever, and something has started answering. Signal carefully. It learns whatever pattern you use.",
      "at": 1792014353104
    },
    {
      "id": "ae2da27c7ed4",
      "kind": "growth",
      "who": "architect",
      "text": "The architect built The Reply, Which Is Everywhere Now (). New here: The Answer, Up Close, Your Pattern, Returned, The Lens That Came Loose, Lumen, the lamplighter, Letters to the Architect, page 5, Ditto.",
      "at": 1792014441832
    },
    {
      "id": "723bde0a44f9",
      "kind": "note",
      "who": "the architect",
      "text": "Past the plain the dark ends, which is worse. It answers now before you ask. Bring no light if you want to keep it.",
      "at": 1792014441832
    }
  ],
